    "field": "argument_node.doc",
    "value": "A connector: an x-y path with interior inside Q, from adjacent entry points and interior reachability."
  },
  {
    "field": "argument_node.pretty",
    "value": "∀ {ι : Type u_1} {𝒞 : Finset (Finset ι)} {Q : ι → Prop} {x y u₁ u₂ : ι},\n  x ≠ y →\n    HiddenChannelCapacity.Adj 𝒞 x u₁ →\n      HiddenChannelCapacity.Adj 𝒞 y u₂ →\n        HiddenChannelCapacity.ReachOn 𝒞 Q u₁ u₂ →\n          ¬Q x →\n            ¬Q y →\n              ∃ p,\n                List.IsChain (HiddenChannelCapacity.Adj 𝒞) p ∧\n                  p.Nodup ∧ p.head? = some x ∧ p.getLast? = some y ∧ ∀ v ∈ p, v = x ∨ v = y ∨ Q v"
  },
